  "description": "Get set for a fantastic ride with the MTB Pro – the ultimate companion for a thrilling mountain biking experience! Built for those seeking exciting adventures, this bike effortlessly combines style, performance, and durability to elevate your riding experience.\nThe custom 27.5” Alloy 6061 frame opens the door to unexplored trails, while the sleek all black fork with 100mm of travel ensures a smooth ride over challenging terrains. Those pesky potholes and unfinished streets around town? Yes, it takes them in its stride as well.With comfortable grips and wide bars, this bike offers precise steering for a fulfilling trail experience. The 2.35” tyres and 27.5” wheels provide unmatched stability, and the mechanical disc brakes ensure controlled stops on tricky descents or in inclement weather.\nEnjoy seamless gear shifts from Shimano, making climbs and descents a breeze. All this is backed up by sealed bottom bracket and headset, and quality finishing kit. The MTB Pro isn't just a bike; it's a gateway to a lifestyle where every trail is an opportunity for a memorable adventure. Equally, it’s just at home getting around town or accompanying the kids as they begin their cycling journey.\nGet ready to enjoy a bike that will become a faithful companion wherever your adventures take you",
